{
    "default_profile": "configs/smartrf_uhf_435.txt",
    "_notes": [
        "CC1200 packet mode needs exact sync word match to detect frames.",
        "AX.25 G3RUH satellites: sync 0x7E is scrambled on air -> CC1200 CANNOT detect.",
        "AX.100 Mode 5: sync 0x930B51DE is NOT scrambled -> CC1200 CAN detect.",
        "USP: needs Viterbi decode -> CC1200 serial mode only.",
        "protocol field: 'ax100_mode5' | 'ax25_g3ruh' | 'usp' | 'csp' | 'native_cc1200'",
        "Most 9600 GFSK sats use G3RUH scrambling which defeats CC1200 packet engine."
    ],
